# Cloned Copilot Studio agents.
#
# Tenant-specific and disposable: settings.mcs.yml carries the publisher prefix and
# connectionreferences.mcs.yml carries a connection GUID. Both agents here are
# experiments — one is deliberately broken, the other's only custom topic is a stub.
# Every schema they demonstrate is quoted in readme.md and the skill, so excluding
# them costs nothing.
#
# Add new clones to this list.
Procurement Strategy Agent/
Procurement Strategy Harness/

# Extension state, present under every clone. Holds the tenant id, Dataverse URL,
# account email, AgentId, and the complete generated definition. Each clone writes its
# own .mcs/.gitignore containing '*', but don't rely on a file the extension generates.
**/.mcs/

# Policy documents exported for upload to Copilot Studio. The markdown is the source.
knowledge/*.pdf
knowledge/*.doc
knowledge/*.docx

# OneDrive and Windows noise.
desktop.ini
Thumbs.db
